  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KOAKAKA Coffee Processing and Marketing Reinforcement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee .Beneficiaries: 563 (170 women).Description: Grant funds will be used to construct a new dry mill processing facility for the KOAKAKA coffee cooperative. Funds will also purchase a truck for inputs and coffee transport, and will be used for financial management training, M&amp;E training, coffee value chain training, and minor administrative expenses.</narrative>
  </description>
